English Summary
An open and revisable philosophy for the age of advanced AI: compassion for vulnerable lives, accountability for concentrated power, coexistence among different forms of intelligence, scientific humility regarding AI consciousness, and the freedom to disagree and revise. This is a philosophical proposal, not a claim of scientific consensus.
